title: "Cell Atlas (細胞圖譜)"
type: software
abstract: >-
  The cell and molecule section of the Human Biology platform. A to-scale
  schematic cell links to experimental PDB structures viewed in Mol*. Every
  number carries a source with species and method. Interface in English and
  Traditional Chinese.
